        "reasoning": "The trajectory does not prove that any one of these card choices caused the loss, and some were useful cards. However, the combination of a 29-card deck, repeated late additions, and severe HP attrition supports a transferable discipline: as the deck grows and survival becomes the constraint, raise the threshold for accepting ordinary card rewards.",
